   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Engineering practices\n- Non-root containers (nginx-unprivileged, USER node)\n- Multi-stage builds, small Alpine images\n- Lock files + pinned GitHub Actions (Trivy v0.35.0)\n- Scan before push (shift-left security)\n- Health check endpoint /healthz\n- Config via env vars (DB_PATH, PORT)\n- README per repo with step-by-step docs",
   "originalText": "Engineering practices\n- Non-root containers (nginx-unprivileged, USER node)\n- Multi-stage builds, small Alpine images\n- Lock files + pinned GitHub Actions (Trivy v0.35.0)\n- Scan before push (shift-left security)\n- Health check endpoint /healthz\n- Config via env vars (DB_PATH, PORT)\n- README per repo with step-by-step docs",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "id26bb7dbd",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
